ridad Alimentaria y Nutrición, is the Spanish Agency for Food Safety and Nutrition. This agency is tasked with regulating food safety and ensuring that nutrition standards are upheld in Spain. Its primary role is to oversee and enforce regulations that protect consumers and promote public health related to food consumption.", "FEDERACIÓN DE ASOCIACIONES DE CELIACOS DE ESPAÑA:The \"FEDERACIÓN DE ASOCIACIONES DE CELIACOS DE ESPAÑA\" (FACE) is the leading organization in Spain dedicated to advocating for the rights and needs of individuals affected by celiac disease. This federation plays a crucial role in raising awareness and providing support for those with the condition. Additionally, FACE offers comprehensive information regarding gluten-free foods and dietary recommendations specifically tailored for celiac patients, ensuring they have access to the necessary resources to manage their health effectively.", "COMPLEJO HOSPITALARIO UNIVERSITARIO DE SANTIAGO:The Complex University Hospital of Santiago is a major healthcare facility in Santiago de Compostela, A Coruña, specializing in various medical fields including endocrinology.", "REGLAMENTO (CE) Nº 834/2007:Reglamento (CE) nº 834/2007 is a regulation regarding the production and labeling of organic products in the European Union.", "MANUAL DE ETIQUETADO DE PRODUCTOS ECOLÓGICOS:The Manual de etiquetado de productos ecológicos is a guide published by the Junta de Andalucía concerning the labeling of organic products.", "FUNDACIÓN VASCA PARA LA SEGURIDAD AGROALIMENTARIA:Fundación Vasca para la Seguridad Agroalimentaria (ELIKA) focuses on food safety and innovation in the Basque Country.", "REGLAMENTO DE EJECUCIÓN (CE) NO. 828/2014:", "GRUPOS POBLACIONALES SUSCEPTIBLES:Los grupos poblacionales susceptibles incluyen ancianos, pacientes oncológicos y hospitalizados, quienes tienen un mayor riesgo de desnutrición.", "BISTRIAN B:Bistrian B is an author who co-authored research on malnutrition syndromes and their continuum in clinical settings.", "ROUBENOFF R:Roubenoff R is a researcher and author who has made significant contributions to the understanding of sarcopenia and its implications for the elderly. In addition to his work on sarcopenia, he is also involved in researching malnutrition syndromes and their clinical implications, highlighting the importance of nutrition in the health and well-being of older adults.", "HEIMBURGER DC:Heimburger DC is an author who contributed to the understanding of malnutrition syndromes in clinical practice."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}